WEBVTT

42:00.503 --> 42:03.547
How long has it been now?
What, 10 years?

42:04.507 --> 42:06.133
I remember.

42:06.258 --> 42:08.719
Was it uncomfortable at Winterfell?

42:08.844 --> 42:10.805
Were there days when
you just couldn't get warm,

42:10.930 --> 42:14.225
never mind how many fires
your servants built?

42:14.350 --> 42:17.186
- I build my own fires.
- That's admirable.

42:18.479 --> 42:21.357
I spent six months out there,
beyond the Wall

42:21.482 --> 42:24.235
during the last winter.

42:24.360 --> 42:28.197
It was supposed to be
a two-week mission.

42:28.322 --> 42:31.575
We heard a rumor Mance Rayder
was planning to attack Eastwatch.
